{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19697","headline":"奉送范司空赴朔方 · 吕温","name":"奉送范司空赴朔方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筑坛登上将，膝席委前筹。\n虏灭南侵迹，朝分北顾忧。\n抗旌回广漠，抚劒动旄头。\n坐见黄云暮，行看白草秋。\n山横旧秦塞，河绕古灵州。\n戍守如无事，惟应猎骑游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}